<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Weapons (Recoil Control)</Major>
    <Description>        JITTER AIM 2026
Technical Requirements:
Driver: Must be ENABLED in the settings ("Use driver for mouse control in macros") to ensure the macro functions correctly.

Resolution: 1920x1080.
DPI: 800 DPI.
Movement: Relative Micro-Offsets.

  Overview:
This macro is designed for Flatline and Havoc users to achieve maximum stability. It bypasses common cursor movement issues by operating through the enabled driver for hardware-level input emulation.

   Recommended Settings:
In-game Sensitivity: 1.2 - 1.5
FOV: 104 or higher.
Mode: Loop while pressed.
  
    Key Advantages:
Effortless Control: Significantly reduces the need for heavy manual mouse pull-down.
Superior Tracking: Makes it much easier to track fast-moving targets while maintaining a steady aim.
Reliability: Engineered for consistency across different attachment levels for the Flatline and Havoc.
</Description>
    <Comment>1.Set the execution mode to "Loop while pressed".

2.Screen Resolution: 1920x1080

3.DPI Settings: Optimized for 800 DPI.

4.In-game Sensitivity: Best performance is achieved between 1.2 and 2.5.

4.If the jitter feels too strong or too weak, slightly 4.adjust your in-game sensitivity by 0.1 increments.

5.For the most stable visual experience, a Field of View (FOV) of 104 or higher is recommended.

6.Driver: Must be ENABLED in the settings ("Use driver for mouse control in macros") to ensure the macro functions correctly.</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR -4 5
Delay 4 ms
MoveR 4 -5
Delay 4 ms
MoveR 4 5
Delay 4 ms
MoveR -4 -5
Delay 4 ms
Goto 2</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>